# The build context is the git checkout itself, which also holds config.florun,
# update.log and .git. Allowlist: start by excluding everything, then re-admit
# exactly the files the image needs. A denylist would eventually leak one of
# those into a layer the moment someone adds a file and forgets to update it --
# and here the sensitive files are not hypothetical, they are siblings of the
# ones being copied.
*
!index.html
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!nginx.conf
!Dockerfile
!css/
!css/*.css
!js/
!js/*.js
!icons/
!icons/*
